#: ../../../rest/folder-versions-get.rst:2
msgid "GET /rest/folder/versions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../rest/folder-versions-get.rst:6
msgid ""
"Takes one mandatory parameter, ``folder``, and returns the list of archived "
"files that could be recovered.  How many versions are available depends on "
"the :doc:`/users/versioning` configuration.  Each entry specifies when the "
"file version was archived as the ``versionTime``, the ``modTime`` when it "
"was last modified before being archived, and the size in bytes."
msgstr ""

